flowchart TB
    SERVER["Mail service<br/>the public home for your company email name"]
    ACCOUNT["Email account<br/>one owned sending and receiving address"]
    BOXES["Mailboxes<br/>INBOX, Spam, Sent, and custom folders"]
    MESSAGE["Messages<br/>content, sender, recipients, dates, and delivery status"]
    PARTS["Useful message content<br/>text, pictures, and attachments"]
    OUTBOX["Individual deliveries<br/>one per recipient"]
    DELIVERY["Delivery history<br/>sent status, attempts, next try, and latest problem"]
    OWNER["Daptin account<br/>owns the address and its mail"]

    SERVER -->|hosts| ACCOUNT
    OWNER -->|owns| ACCOUNT
    ACCOUNT -->|organizes mail into| BOXES
    BOXES -->|contain| MESSAGE
    MESSAGE -->|can be unpacked into| PARTS
    ACCOUNT -->|sends through| OUTBOX
    OUTBOX -->|records| DELIVERY

    classDef foundation fill:#EEF2FF,stroke:#6366F1,color:#1E1B4B,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef identity fill:#FFF7ED,stroke:#F59E0B,color:#7C2D12,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef content fill:#ECFDF5,stroke:#10B981,color:#064E3B,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef delivery fill:#FDF4FF,stroke:#C026D3,color:#701A75,stroke-width:2px;
    class SERVER foundation;
    class OWNER,ACCOUNT identity;
    class BOXES,MESSAGE,PARTS content;
    class OUTBOX,DELIVERY delivery;
